/stream.rs\n M crates/source/kinesis/src/shard.rs\n M crates/source/postgres-cdc/README.md\nMM crates/source/postgres-cdc/src/replication.rs\n M crates/source/postgres-cdc/src/stream.rs\n M crates/source/rest/src/decode.rs\n M crates/source/s3/Cargo.toml\n M crates/\n... (truncated because it exceeds 2k characters. If you need more information, run \"git status\" using Bash)\n\nRecent commits:\ne8e4c78b test(http): pin both retry-wait arms (server Retry-After wins; otherwise never a hot loop)\nb7a218e4 refactor(mssql): convert plain errors to ChunkError via From instead of per-site map_err\n8c298f8a refactor(mssql): extract the pure column-quoting step so its failure path is unit-testable\n7cd84ffa fix: close the four message-grep correctness paths and the core retry gate\nfd32cf08 feat: generic REST discovery, partitioned typed OData, byte-passthrough loads + BigQuery/serve upgrades (#650)\n\nIMPORTANT: this context may or may not be relevant to your tasks. You should not respond to this context unless it is highly relevant to your task.\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/audit-correctness-paths","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
