{"parentUuid":"70522842-6d65-4878-aec8-8d642c9dee23","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf99jVyY3NJ1oqLF5SFWx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now re-arm auto-merge with an explicit message so GitHub can't inject trailers from its auto-generated one:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3268,"cache_read_input_tokens":297727,"output_tokens":789,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3268,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":789,"cache_read_input_tokens":297727,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3268,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3268},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf99jVWFdyw8bJ12ygeCf","type":"assistant","uuid":"3211faeb-a8c6-4d58-99c7-92fb32e61aac","timestamp":"2026-09-17T14:14:43.718Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/audit-correctness-paths","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"3211faeb-a8c6-4d58-99c7-92fb32e61aac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf99jVyY3NJ1oqLF5SFWx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0183KMfTrfqmme8FGmZoqMsa","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\ngh auth switch --user PawanSikawat >/dev/null 2>&1 && gh pr merge 656 --auto --squash --delete-branch \\\n  --subject \"fix: replace every message-grep classification with a typed one, and close the core retry gate (#656)\" \\\n  --body \"Closes the non-breaking half of the principles audit (#654).\n\nCore: \\`with_retry_write!\\` was gated on \\`supports_idempotent_writes()\\`, which\nonly promises atomicity on the *idempotent* write path — eleven sinks advertise\nit while their plain write is a bare multi-row INSERT, so the macro retried\nexactly the writes its own comment forbids. Now gated on a defaulted\n\\`Sink::write_batch_is_replay_safe()\\`.\n\nTyped classification replaces string matching in nine places: delta\nmissing-table (a 403 read as 'no table' orphaned every data file), spanner\nexactly-once watermark, mssql transience (a UNIQUE-constraint name containing\n'connection' was called transient, so the poison row never reached the DLQ),\nthe scheduler's circuit-open cooldown, run-history backend transience, graphql\nrequest rejection, and the parquet arrow decoder.\n\nAlso: one jitter implementation across five retry sites (the websocket\nreconnect had no ceiling at all and redialled a dead endpoint forever);\nreserved names get one definition each; \\`sql_literal\\` is public with its ANSI\ncontract stated and ClickHouse documents why it must diverge; the XML decoder\nno longer panics on unbalanced network input; \\`deny_unknown_fields\\` on the five\nconfig blocks still missing it.\n\nAddresses #654\" 2>&1 | tail -3\necho \"=== verify:\"; gh pr view 656 --json autoMergeRequest --jq '.autoMergeRequest | {headline: .commitHeadline, hasBody: (.commitBody != null)}'","description":"Re-arm auto-merge with an explicit commit message"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3268,"cache_read_input_tokens":297727,"output_tokens":789,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3268,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":789,"cache_read_input_tokens":297727,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3268,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3268},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_0183KMfTrfqmme8FGmZoqMsa":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\ngh auth switch --user PawanSikawat >/dev/null 2>&1 && gh pr merge 656 --auto --squash --delete-branch \\\n  --subject \"fix: replace every message-grep classification with a typed one, and close the core retry gate (#656)\" \\\n  --body \"Closes the non-breaking half of the principles audit (#654).\n\nCore: \\`with_retry_write!\\` was gated on \\`supports_idempotent_writes()\\`, which\nonly promises atomicity on the *idempotent* write path — eleven sinks advertise\nit while their plain write is a bare multi-row INSERT, so the macro retried\nexactly the writes its own comment forbids. Now gated on a defaulted\n\\`Sink::write_batch_is_replay_safe()\\`.\n\nTyped classification replaces string matching in nine places: delta\nmissing-table (a 403 read as 'no table' orphaned every data file), spanner\nexactly-once watermark, mssql transience (a UNIQUE-constraint name containing\n'connection' was called transient, so the poison row never reached the DLQ),\nthe scheduler's circuit-open cooldown, run-history backend transience, graphql\nrequest rejection, and the parquet arrow decoder.\n\nAlso: one jitter implementation across five retry sites (the websocket\nreconnect had no ceiling at all and redialled a dead endpoint forever);\nreserved names get one definition each; \\`sql_literal\\` is public with its ANSI\ncontract stated and ClickHouse documents why it must diverge; the XML decoder\nno longer panics on unbalanced network input; \\`deny_unknown_fields\\` on the five\nconfig blocks still missing it.\n\nAddresses #654\" 2>&1 | tail -3\necho \"=== verify:\"; gh pr view 656 --json autoMergeRequest --jq '.autoMergeRequest | {headline: .commitHeadline, hasBody: (.commitBody != null)}'","description":"Re-arm auto-merge with an explicit commit message"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf99jVWFdyw8bJ12ygeCf","type":"assistant","uuid":"8de24a14-4cd9-43ce-a583-b05fc66e119d","timestamp":"2026-09-17T14:14:52.937Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/audit-correctness-paths","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
