{"parentUuid":"0ae7c1aa-4a4a-4e34-87d9-b0f8b77059be","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e18870a3-f20c-4f4a-a2be-e46c57c8b404","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013MUqDXo9cMwNf7JVP4eC6X","type":"tool_result","content":"ci: make the reliability gate always report so it can be required (#661)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7a94ff69-e0de-4abd-aab3-b4605c7a17e6","timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:16:36.329Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ci: make the reliability gate always report so it can be required (#661)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0ae7c1aa-4a4a-4e34-87d9-b0f8b77059be","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/reliability-job-always-runs","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"7a94ff69-e0de-4abd-aab3-b4605c7a17e6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_013MUqDXo9cMwNf7JVP4eC6X","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"terminalSequence\":\"\\u001b]777;notify;warp://cli-agent;{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"tool_complete\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"faucet-stream\\\",\\\"tool_name\\\":\\\"Bash\\\"}\\u0007\"}\n","stderr":"/Users/c-sikawats/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-code-warp/warp/2.2.0/scripts/emit-terminal-sequence.sh: line 82: /dev/tty: Device not configured\n","exitCode":0,"command":"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/on-post-tool-use.sh","durationMs":349},"type":"attachment","uuid":"00b5e4b2-8b4b-423b-88a1-50d2012e4ec6","timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:16:36.328Z","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/reliability-job-always-runs","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"00b5e4b2-8b4b-423b-88a1-50d2012e4ec6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14772610 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8eaf5c11-9941-4da5-9fb7-a4bbb07a9234","timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:16:36.339Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14772610 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/reliability-job-always-runs","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"8eaf5c11-9941-4da5-9fb7-a4bbb07a9234","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfA2D5Ds2gU2GVV3nj2QA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**#660 is merged** — the reliability program is on `main`. Every required check passed, including `Coverage` (the 95% patch gate) and `Test`.\n\nThen, preparing the last step, I found a bug in my own work and fixed it in **[#661](https://github.com/faucet-hq/faucet-stream/pull/661)** (auto-merge armed).\n\nI'd copied the job-level `if` gate from `test` — but `test` is deliberately *not* a required check, and this job is meant to be. None of the actually-required jobs has a job-level gate, and `clippy`'s own comment says why: *\"Required check → job always runs (stays green), but the heavy step is gated.\"*\n\nHad I gone ahead and marked the context required, **every docs-only PR would have been blocked** — the job would skip, and a skipped required check can sit on \"Expected — waiting for status\" forever. That's the identical failure mode CLAUDE.md documents for `codecov/patch`. The fix moves the condition to the four expensive steps, so a docs-only PR reports green in seconds and a code PR runs the suites unchanged.\n\nThat's why I sequenced branch protection last rather than doing it when the job first passed.\n\n**Where #651 stands:** 56 tests across 7 suites, the shared harness, the required CI gate, the docs page, and the per-item audit — all on `main`. The gate runs in **53 seconds** against `Test`'s 1h13m, which is what makes it viable as a per-PR requirement.\n\nRemaining, once #661 lands:\n\n1. Add `Reliability guarantees` to the required set via the granular `PATCH` endpoint, preserving the existing eight contexts.\n2. The four container/nightly items I flagged — remaining fidelity pairs needing emulators, toxiproxy for E1, live `evolve` DDL for A6.\n\nStill open for you: whether those four keep #651 open or become separate tier-2 issues, and whether you want the redundant B/C/D coverage the issue specified (my read remains that it would be duplicates of the 292 existing files)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":604070,"output_tokens":673,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":578,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":604070,"cache_creation_input_tokens":578,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":578},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfA2D4RV4YqTKWSRCoshQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"5ffedc53-0b86-4bd0-b7fb-688a85e87fbe","timestamp":"2026-09-18T01:16:46.606Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/reliability-job-always-runs","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
