{"parentUuid":"6f21352f-d6cb-47df-9412-b322ecbc1657","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfALGJ7w4nVucyaiswup8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No cycle. `faucet-sink-jsonl` depends only on `faucet-conformance` and `faucet-core`, so the new dev-dep edge (`sqlite` → `jsonl`) just adds an ordering constraint: jsonl publishes before sqlite. A full dev-inclusive cycle scan across all 92 crates comes back clean.\n\nWorth checking because per the release notes in `publishing.md`, the per-crate publish order must include dev-dependency edges — a versioned workspace dev-dep blocks `cargo publish` until its target is on crates.io, and a cycle there would deadlock the release entirely.\n\nThree CLI builds green on #663 so far. Waiting on the rest."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1268,"cache_read_input_tokens":694427,"output_tokens":232,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1268,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":232,"cache_read_input_tokens":694427,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1268,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1268},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfALGHR1dkg79S6ZFMEMt","type":"assistant","uuid":"361a33b8-a585-4041-b742-1b403e601802","timestamp":"2026-09-18T05:13:27.753Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch