{"parentUuid":"06ee4d94-c1d4-418a-963f-ae3e5129f2cd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e0f7f418-adf2-4227-9df5-4e6afef6b88f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011FRbSGLzmdQhP1ae3ausE8","type":"tool_result","content":"=== all open issues (any label):\n38\t[tier-1,epic]\tRoadmap: faucet-stream connector & runtime coverage\n91\t[documentation,enhancement,tier-2]\tAdoption & DX epic: docs.rs, docs site, positioning, examples & community polish for 1.0 launch\n179\t[enhancement,tier-3,blocked-upstream]\tfaucet-sink-iceberg: add overwrite write mode (blocked on upstream iceberg-rust)\n220\t[enhancement,tier-3,blocked-upstream]\tGCS connectors lack an integration-test coverage path (gRPC, no emulator)\n225\t[feature,tier-2,blocked-upstream]\tSink: Iceberg upsert via equality deletes (version-gated on iceberg-rust)\n314\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tAdoption: ongoing publicity, distribution & growth playbook (WS-11 of #91)\n561\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat(source-rabbitmq,sink-rabbitmq): RabbitMQ (AMQP 0.9.1) source + sink connector pair\n565\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tShip prebuilt Windows binaries (x86_64-pc-windows-msvc)\n571\t[feature,tier-2]\tTemplate Hub: source/sink-split templates with per-stream write + capability-matched composition\n572\t[feature,tier-2]\tConnector Hub: auto-generated, crates.io-backed connector catalog with conformance tiers + third-party discovery\n580\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tfeat(sinks): consistent auto-create-table (schema-inferred) across all table-based sinks\n583\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tTechnical white-paper program (flagship: Governance in the Movement Path)\n589\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat(serve): template hosting + sync (github/s3/gcs/azure; pull-based)\n591\t[feature,tier-3]\tfeat(serve-ui): non-local dataset preview (BigQuery/Snowflake/DB) — RFC-gated\n604\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tFile connectors: uniform CSV/JSON/XML/Excel formats + configurable compression across all sources & sinks\n608\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tserve: first-class read/write/admin token trio + verified RBAC permission matrix\n609\t[bug,tier-2]\tTemplate register accepts a wrongly-formatted connector config (only caught at run time)\n610\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tPer-run concurrency override at trigger time (POST /v1/runs and POST /v1/templates/{id}/runs)\n611\t[bug,tier-1,launch-blocker]\tBigQuery sink: tables.get sends selectedFields=schema → 400 on any existing table\n612\t[enhancement,tier-1,launch-blocker]\tBigQuery sink: per-page jobs.query makes loads job-latency-bound (60k rows ≈ 6 min); use a load job / larger batching\n613\t[bug,tier-2,launch-blocker]\tTransformingSource re-chunks to the 1000-row hint, silently defeating a source's batch_size\n614\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tBigQuery sink: streaming bounded-memory bucket-free load (resumable NDJSON, then Parquet) — decouple memory from atomicity\n617\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tWarehouse sinks (snowflake/redshift/clickhouse) commit per source page — add cross-page accumulate-and-flush bulk commit\n618\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tObject-store sinks (s3/gcs/azure/sftp): one object per page (small-files) + whole-object buffering, no multipart streaming\n619\t[bug,tier-2]\tObject-store sources: `concurrency` is a no-op on the streaming path (serial object reads in real runs) + whole-object Parquet buffering\n620\t[bug,tier-2]\tLakehouse sinks: delta `target_file_size` dead knob + O(whole-table) bulk memory; coalesce CDC commits (delta/iceberg)\n621\t[enhancement,tier-3]\tWarehouse source read throughput: concurrent partition/stream prefetch + BigQuery Storage-Read for SQL + fetch-size knob\n623\t[bug,tier-2]\tREST source: Salesforce Bulk / async_job buffers the entire result set into one page (O(whole extract) memory, non-resumable)\n624\t[enhancement,tier-3]\tREST source: CSV/Excel file mode buffers whole file (Excel double-materializes) + partition_concurrency ignored on the streaming path\n625\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tREST source: streaming bounded-memory CSV decode — decouple peak memory from result-set size (3.96 GB for one 838k-row Salesforce Bulk result)\n626\t[enhancement,tier-1]\tREST source: stream CSV decode to bound peak memory to batch size (3.96 GB for one 838k-row Salesforce Bulk result)\n627\t[bug,tier-2,launch-blocker]\tREST source: Auth::TokenEndpoint only sends JSON — OAuth token endpoints (Salesforce/Google) need application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n628\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tREST async_job: adaptive exponential poll backoff (fixed interval wastes ~11s on quick Bulk jobs)\n629\t[enhancement,tier-3]\tREST/Salesforce source: use synchronous SOQL query API for small objects (Bulk's ~14s async floor is ~10x too slow for small data)\n632\t[enhancement,tier-2,launch-blocker]\tkeys_case: add collision disambiguation (fails on wide Salesforce objects where two fields re-case to the same name; z3z1ma auto-suffixes)\n634\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tfeat(cli): opt-in JSON structured logging (--log-format json / FAUCET_LOG_FORMAT)\n635\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat: Arrow-columnar REST/Salesforce → BigQuery via bucket-free Parquet load (DataFrame path)\n636\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat(core): vectorized Arrow-native transforms/quality/contract/masking (columnar governance)\n637\t[enhancement,tier-3]\tfeat(serve-ui): three-tier button affordance (amber warn / red danger) for destructive actions\n638\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat(observability): protocol-agnostic upstream round-trip counter for every source/sink (roundtrips_total{op})\n640\t[bug,tier-2]\tfix(catalog/lineage): query-based sources collapse to one dataset — dataset_uri() must include the object/table, not just the endpoint\n644\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tfeat(executor): cost-aware (LPT) dispatch order for matrix roots to cut makespan\n646\t[enhancement,tier-3]\tfeat(serve-ui): Datasets/Lineage console UX — aligned table, filters, preview polish, lighter nodes\n648\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat: parameter-combination test suites for pipeline templates (faucet template test)\n652\t[bug,tier-2]\tValue-path overwrite can persist a bookmark that outruns a failed commit_overwrite\n654\t[bug,tier-1]\tPrinciples audit: 4 silent-incorrectness paths (2 data-loss), a core retry-gate defect, and systemic config-strictness debt\n657\t[bug,tier-2]\tbug(sink-kafka): `headers_path` is parsed and extracted but never attached to the produced message\n658\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tenhancement(core/cli): carry a typed failure kind on `NodeReport` so topology runs get the same circuit-open cooldown as matrix runs\n662\t[bug,tier-2]\tbug: SQL sources type a runtime query/connection failure as `FaucetError::Config`\n\n=== total open: 49\n=== 651: CLOSED","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3355324c-e3e9-40bc-b4e9-5757ab12208e","timestamp":"2026-09-18T07:39:18.515Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== all open issues (any label):\n38\t[tier-1,epic]\tRoadmap: faucet-stream connector & runtime coverage\n91\t[documentation,enhancement,tier-2]\tAdoption & DX epic: docs.rs, docs site, positioning, examples & community polish for 1.0 launch\n179\t[enhancement,tier-3,blocked-upstream]\tfaucet-sink-iceberg: add overwrite write mode (blocked on upstream iceberg-rust)\n220\t[enhancement,tier-3,blocked-upstream]\tGCS connectors lack an integration-test coverage path (gRPC, no emulator)\n225\t[feature,tier-2,blocked-upstream]\tSink: Iceberg upsert via equality deletes (version-gated on iceberg-rust)\n314\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tAdoption: ongoing publicity, distribution & growth playbook (WS-11 of #91)\n561\t[feature,tier-2]\tfeat(source-rabbitmq,sink-rabbitmq): RabbitMQ (AMQP 0.9.1) source + sink connector pair\n565\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tShip prebuilt Windows binaries (x86_64-pc-windows-msvc)\n571\t[feature,tier-2]\tTemplate Hub: source/sink-split templates with per-stream write + capability-matched composition\n572\t[feature,tier-2]\tConnector Hub: auto-generated, crates.io-backed connector catalog with conformance tiers + third-party discovery\n580\t[enhancement,tier-2]\tfeat(sinks): consistent auto-create-table (sc