aucetError::Config, the\nvariant meaning 'your YAML is wrong'. Six sites across three crates now return\nSource; connect-time sites stay Config and say why inline. The issue's\nnine-source claim was mine and was wrong — corrected there.\n\nCloses #652\nCloses #657\nCloses #662\" 2>&1 | tail -2\ngh pr view 664 --json autoMergeRequest --jq '.autoMergeRequest.commitHeadline'","description":"Arm auto-merge on 664"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfAb7qFg3xmf34icbhA8P","type":"assistant","uuid":"7f66d728-9eb5-4d54-b490-e2873d4a677c","timestamp":"2026-09-18T08:28:20.050Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/overwrite-bookmark-ordering","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
