'{}': {e}\", node.id)))?;\n        }\"\"\"\nassert old in s\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s.replace(old,new,1))\nprint(\"register wired\")\nPY\necho \"=== now faucet validate — where does it expand?\"\ngrep -n \"expand::expand\\|check_transforms\" cli/src/commands/validate.rs | head -6","description":"Wire validation into register"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":351,"cache_read_input_tokens":823378,"output_tokens":764,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":351,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":764,"cache_read_input_tokens":823378,"cache_creation_input_tokens":351,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":351},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01SD6bbNYnGd2eta1NC9VpX2":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\npython3 - <<'PY'\np=\"cli/src/templates/store.rs\"\ns=open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"        for node in crate::expand::expand(&cfg)? {\n            if node.transforms.is_empty() {\n                continue;\n            }\n            crate::transforms::compile_transforms(&node.transforms)\n                .map_err(|e| CliError::Config(format!(\"row '{}': {e}\", node.id)))?;\n        }\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"        for node in crate::expand::expand(&cfg)? {\n            // Deserialize each connector's `config` into its typed struct\n            // (#609). `expand` leaves it an opaque `Value`, so without this a\n            // structurally wrong config — the wrong nesting under a flattened\n            // block, an unknown field, a typo'd name — registers cleanly,\n            // la