{"parentUuid":"18313f79-27bd-45f9-b5fc-9c7be8ec89ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfAdPP7jnGketWZUXdR5u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015dw7iE92at1qhnF8qSuas5","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\npython3 - <<'PY'\np=\"crates/source/rest/src/config.rs\"\ns=open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"    pub headers: HashMap<String, String>,\n    pub query_params: HashMap<String, String>,\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"    pub headers: HashMap<String, String>,\n    /// Static query-string parameters, rendered as `?k=v`. Values honor\n    /// `{placeholder}` context substitution for child sources. Empty by\n    /// default.\n    ///\n    /// The `#[serde(default)]` here is load-bearing: without it this field was\n    /// **required**, so any config omitting it failed to deserialize — while\n    /// its siblings `headers` and `query_params_multi` both defaulted. Several\n    /// shipped examples omitted it and could not run at all, which nothing\n    /// caught because `faucet validate` did not deserialize connector configs\n    /// until #609.\n    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"HashMap::is_empty\")]\n    #[schemars(with = \"std::collections::HashMap<String, String>\")]\n    pub query_params: HashMap<String, String>,\"\"\"\nassert old in s\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s.replace(old,new,1))\nprint(\"query_params now defaults\")\nPY\nTOOL=~/.rustup/toolchains/1.96.0-aarch64-apple-darwin/bin\nexport PATH=$TOOL:$PATH RUSTC=$TOOL/rustc CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0\ncargo build -p faucet-cli --all-features -q 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A 5 | head -10\nexport AIRTABLE_BASE_ID=app AIRTABLE_TOKEN=x API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com API_CLIENT_ID=x API_CLIENT_SECRET=x API_KEY=x API_PASS=x API_TOKEN=x API_TOKEN_URL=https://auth.example.com/t API_USER=x AUTH_TOKEN=x DATABRICKS_TOKEN=x DEST_PG_URL=REDACTED ES_API_KEY=x ES_PASS=x ES_USER=x FAUCET_WEBHOOK_SECRET=x FEED_