{"parentUuid":"85cb6921-b2fa-42a2-8629-cd8878bd788e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_non_blocking_error","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_012q5rtxnoKA2xUxssPNaRed","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","stderr":"Failed with non-blocking status code: /bin/sh: rtk: command not found","stdout":"","exitCode":127,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":54},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4658f980-0737-44a5-a143-284f18924c0c","timestamp":"2026-09-18T10:10:46.328Z","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/overwrite-bookmark-ordering","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"85cb6921-b2fa-42a2-8629-cd8878bd788e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0b270ed8-79ad-458f-b783-66e7a379786e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012q5rtxnoKA2xUxssPNaRed","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"autoMergeRequest\":{\"authorEmail\":null,\"commitBody\":\"Three open bugs fixed for the reliability release, each verified against the\\nlive code first.\\n\\n#652 — silent data loss: run_stream checkpointed each bookmark before\\nPipeline::run decided the overwrite outcome, so a failed commit_overwrite left\\nthe destination untouched while the state store claimed delivery, and the next\\nincremental run resumed past the gap permanently. Bookmarks are now held under\\nis_overwrite() and persisted only after the swap commits. Verified by reverting\\nthe fix: four of five new tests fail.\\n\\n#657 — kafka headers_path was accepted, extracted and documented, then never\\nattached to the message. Wired on both the at-least-once and transactional\\npaths; the commit-token record deliberately carries none. A JSON null now\\nbecomes a valueless header rather than the string 'null'. Five tests consume\\nthe messages back and read their headers.\\n\\n#662 — query sources typed runtime query failures as FaucetError::Config, the\\nvariant meaning 'your YAML is wrong'. Six sites across three crates now return\\nSource; connect-time sites stay Config and say why inline. The issue's\\nnine-source claim was mine and was wrong — corrected there.\\n\\nCloses #652\\nCloses #657\\nCloses #662\",\"commitHeadline\":\"fix: three reliability bugs — overwrite bookmark ordering, kafka headers, source error typing (#664)\",\"mergeMethod\":\"SQUASH\",\"enabledAt\":\"2026-09-18T08:28:25Z\",\"enabledBy\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NDkyODYw\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"pecsorabs\",\"name\":\"\"}},\"headRefName\":\"fix/overwrite-bookmark-ordering\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"number\":664,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: three reliability bugs — overwrite bookmark ordering, kafka headers, source error typing\"}\n--- remote branch","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4cd35f0e-235d-4759-822f-62582d7db365","timestamp":"2026-09-18T10:10:51.227Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"{\"autoMergeRequest\":{\"authorEmail\":null,\"commitBody\":\"Three open bugs fixed for the reliability release, each verified against the\\nlive code first.\\n\\n#652 — silent data loss: run_stream checkpointed each bookmark before\\nPipeline::run decided the overwrite outcome, so a failed commit_overwrite left\\nthe destination untouched while the state store claimed delivery, and the next\\nincremental run resumed past the gap permanently. Bookmarks are now held under\\nis_overwrite() and persisted only after the swap commits. Verified by reverting\\nthe fix: four of five new tests fail.\\n\\n#657 — kafka headers_path was accepted, extracted and documented, then never\\nattached to the message. Wired on both the at-least-once and transactional\\npaths; the commit-token record deliberately carries none. A JSON null now\\nbecomes a valueless header rather than the string 'null'. Five tests consume\\nthe messages back and read their headers.\\n\\n#662 — query sources typed runtime query failures as FaucetError::Config, the\\nvariant meaning 'your YAML is wrong'. Six sites across three crates now return\\nSource; connect-time sites stay Config and say why inline. The issue's\\nnine-source claim was mine and was wrong — corrected there.\\n\\nCloses #652\\nCloses #657\\nCloses #662\",\"commitHeadline\":\"fix: three reliability bugs — overwrite bookmark ordering, kafka headers, source error typing (#664)\",\"mergeMethod\":\"SQUASH\",\"enabledAt\":\"2026-09-18T08:28:25Z\",\"enabledBy\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NDkyODYw\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"pecsorabs\",\"name\":\"\"}},\"headRefName\":\"fix/overwrite-bookmark-ordering\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"number\":664,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"fix: three reliability bugs — overwrite bookmark ordering, kafka headers, source error typing\"}\n--- remote branch","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"85cb6921-b2fa-42a2-8629-cd8878bd788e","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/overwrite-bookmark-ordering","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
