{"parentUuid":"9eefd9fb-bffc-4594-9aba-95e0b88e853c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfAqX5PzyztZ5xD2MTr96","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WnUF9gZj3nvK2PkF1jdNQu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh pr merge 665 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --auto --squash --delete-branch \\\n  --subject \"fix: three inert config knobs — connector config validation, delta target_file_size, object-store concurrency (#665)\" \\\n  --body \"$(printf '%s' \"Three open bugs whose common shape was a config field declared, documented, and in two cases validated — then never acted on.\n\n#609 — faucet validate and template register never deserialized a connector's config into its own type, so a misspelled field passed validation and failed on the first page of a real run. registry.rs gained check/check_with plus generated validate_source_config / validate_sink_config dispatchers across 37 kinds, each also running the config's own validate(). Turning it on caught real defects, fixed here: RestStreamConfig required 22 fields (now per-field defaults, deliberately not a container default, which would empty the schema's required array and break faucet init), query_params was accidentally required on rest and xml, and 16 shipped examples could not run.\n\n#620 — sink-delta's target_file_size was rejected when zero and otherwise never read, so a bookmark-free bulk source produced one commit per run with a parquet buffer holding the whole dataset. delta-rs writes one file per commit, so flush cadence governs file size and wiring the knob is the memory fix: commit_buffered extracted, roll_if_over_target after each write on both the Value and columnar paths, keyed on the writer's own buffer_len().\n\n#619 — two halves. concurrency was inert on the object-store streaming path (buffer_unordered existed only in the eager batch path), so s3/gcs/azure-blob/sftp now prefetch through an ordered buffered(concurrency) look-ahead: reads overlap, listing order and per-object error attribution are unchanged, and 0 is clamped to 1. And Parquet objects were buffered whole on both the row and columnar paths; each source now reads them row group at a time through an AsyncFileReader over ranged reads, with the Arrow batch size capped at batch_size. verify_checksum and compression keep the whole-object path, since each is a guarantee worth more than the memory saving. sftp gains concurrency at default 4 because every read shares one SSH channel.\n\nCloses #609\nCloses #619\nCloses #620\")\" 2>&1 | tail -2\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh pr view 665 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --json autoMergeRequest --jq '.autoMergeRequest.commitHeadline'","description":"Re-arm auto-merge with the updated squash body","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1729,"cache_read_input_tokens":426315,"output_tokens":985,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1729,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":426315,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1729,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1729},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WnUF9gZj3nvK2PkF1jdNQu":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh pr merge 665 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --auto --squash --delete-branch \\\n  --subject \"fix: three inert config knobs — connector config validation, delta target_file_size, object-store concurrency (#665)\" \\\n  --body \"$(printf '%s' \"Three open bugs whose common shape was a config field declared, documented, and in two cases validated — then never acted on.\n\n#609 — faucet validate and template register never deserialized a connector's config into its own type, so a misspelled field passed validation and failed on the first page of a real run. registry.rs gained check/check_with plus generated validate_source_config / validate_sink_config dispatchers across 37 kinds, each also running the config's own validate(). Turning it on caught real defects, fixed here: RestStreamConfig required 22 fields (now per-field defaults, deliberately not a container default, which would empty the schema's required array and break faucet init), query_params was accidentally required on rest and xml, and 16 shipped examples could not run.\n\n#620 — sink-delta's target_file_size was rejected when zero and otherwise never read, so a bookmark-free bulk source produced one commit per run with a parquet buffer holding the whole dataset. delta-rs writes one file per commit, so flush cadence governs file size and wiring the knob is the memory fix: commit_buffered extracted, roll_if_over_target after each write on both the Value and columnar paths, keyed on the writer's own buffer_len().\n\n#619 — two halves. concurrency was inert on the object-store streaming path (buffer_unordered existed only in the eager batch path), so s3/gcs/azure-blob/sftp now prefetch through an ordered buffered(concurrency) look-ahead: reads overlap, listing order and per-object error attribution are unchanged, and 0 is clamped to 1. And Parquet objects were buffered whole on both the row and columnar paths; each source now reads them row group at a time through an AsyncFileReader over ranged reads, with the Arrow batch size capped at batch_size. verify_checksum and compression keep the whole-object path, since each is a guarantee worth more than the memory saving. sftp gains concurrency at default 4 because every read shares one SSH channel.\n\nCloses #609\nCloses #619\nCloses #620\")\" 2>&1 | tail -2\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh pr view 665 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --json autoMergeRequest --jq '.autoMergeRequest.commitHeadline'","timeout":300000,"description":"Re-arm auto-merge with the updated squash body"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfAqX4Nyb8tbVDZiPKy2Y","type":"assistant","uuid":"80e25549-4fb7-43cd-a55c-7fae1e5bb80b","timestamp":"2026-09-18T11:37:12.472Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/inert-config-knobs","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
