{"parentUuid":"89cd0872-3209-400f-8b48-db60a1f2e01f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfAsbXEN8mWY5o86atnYH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The red mark on #665 is a transient crates.io download timeout (`rand_core`, 30 s, 0 bytes received) in `Feature isolation (triggers-redis)` — not a code failure, and not one of the required contexts, so it doesn't block the merge. GitHub won't let me re-run it while the rest of the workflow is still going, so I've queued a background watcher that re-runs the failed job the moment the run completes.\n\nEverything else on both PRs is green or still in flight:\n\n- **#664** — only `Test` and `Coverage` left (they were the two the stale schema broke; the fix is pushed).\n- **#665** — full run restarted from the Parquet + test-refactor commits; no other failures.\n\nBoth still have auto-merge armed with explicit squash subjects/bodies, so they land themselves once the required checks pass. I'll keep watching and fix anything that's actually mine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":546608,"output_tokens":290,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":851,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":290,"cache_read_input_tokens":546608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":851,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":851},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfAsbWafQZZGXwPQn2hS7","type":"assistant","uuid":"b871fb3b-0ec1-4b9b-a20e-cefc246941e0","timestamp":"2026-09-18T12:04:21.119Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort