{"parentUuid":"612390fa-797b-4e0b-8712-ced867a06299","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfCXofWhfx72PcmUBzCHA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two failures, and the diagnosis matters:\n\n- **My timing test is wrong, not the code.** CI shows concurrency=15 at 71–81 ms vs serial at 112–132 ms — the reads *do* overlap (1.6×), but I asserted ≥2×, which CI's lower per-request latency can't reach. A wall-clock ratio was the wrong instrument.\n- **`templates::concurrent_registers...`** — a SQLite \"database is locked\" in a file I never touched; it failed on attempt 1 and passed on retry, while mine failed on attempts 1 and 3. Pre-existing flake.\n\nLet me replace the timing proxy with a direct measurement of overlap — counting simultaneous connections through a local TCP proxy:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1428,"cache_read_input_tokens":620579,"output_tokens":2211,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1831},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1428,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2211,"cache_read_input_tokens":620579,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1428,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1428},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfCXoeujRnwxJqPDoBieG","type":"assistant","uuid":"61744cfa-2366-4579-b185-f50d4e56c4ba","timestamp":"2026-09-19T09:06:26.634Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886