g table\n612\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-1,launch-blocker\tBigQuery sink: per-page jobs.query makes loads job-latency-bound (60k rows ≈ 6 min); use a load job / larger batching\n613\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2,launch-blocker\tTransformingSource re-chunks to the 1000-row hint, silently defeating a source's batch_size\n614\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tBigQuery sink: streaming bounded-memory bucket-free load (resumable NDJSON, then Parquet) — decouple memory from atomicity\n615\tCLOSED\t\tREST source: streaming bounded-memory CSV decode — decouple peak memory from result-set size (3.96 GB for one 838k-row Salesforce Bulk result)\n617\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tWarehouse sinks (snowflake/redshift/clickhouse) commit per source page — add cross-page accumulate-and-flush bulk commit\n618\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tObject-store sinks (s3/gcs/azure/sftp): one object per page (small-files) + whole-object buffering, no multipart streaming\n619\tOPEN\tbug,tier-2\tObject-store sources: `concurrency` is a no-op on the streaming path (serial object reads in real runs) + whole-object Parquet buffering\n620\tOPEN\tbug,tier-2\tLakehouse sinks: delta `target_file_size` dead knob + O(whole-table) bulk memory; coalesce CDC commits (delta/iceberg)\n621\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-3\tWarehouse source read throughput: concurrent partition/stream prefetch + BigQuery Storage-Read for SQL + fetch-size knob\n623\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2\tREST source: Salesforce Bulk / async_job buffers the entire result set into one page (O(whole extract) memory, non-resumable)\n624\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-3\tREST source: CSV/Excel file mode buffers whole file (Excel double-materializes) + partition_concurrency ignored on the streaming path\n625\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tREST source: streaming bounded-memory CSV decode — decouple peak memory from result-set size (3.96 GB for one 838k-row Salesforce Bulk result)\n626\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-1\tREST source: stream CSV decode to bound peak memory to batch size (3.96 GB for one 838k-row Salesforce Bulk result)\n627\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2,launch-blocker\tREST source: Auth::TokenEndpoint only sends JSON — OAuth token endpoints (Salesforce/Google) need application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n628\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tREST async_job: adaptive exponential poll backoff (fixed interval wastes ~11s on quick Bulk jobs)\n629\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-3\tREST/Salesforce source: use synchronous SOQL query API for small objects (Bulk's ~14s async floor is ~10x too slow for small data)\n630\tCLOSED\tenhancement,tier-2,launch-blocker\tREST async_job (Salesforce Bulk): no incremental replication — inject bookmark into SOQL + emit replication bookmark\n631\tCLOSED\tenhancement,tier-2\tPer-run memory observability: tiered (process peak RSS reliable + in-flight-bytes proxy) — surface in run summary/record/console/metric\n632\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2,launch-blocker\tkeys_case: add collision disambiguation (fails on wide Salesforce objects where two fields re-case to the same name; z3z1ma auto-suffixes)\n633\tCLOSED\tfeature,tier-2,launch-blocker\tfeat(core): native byte-passthrough fast-load — third capability-negotiated transfer mechanism (zero-Value CSV/NDJSON source→sink)\n634\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tfeat(cli): opt-in JSON structured logging (--log-format json / FAUCET_LOG_FORMAT)\n635\tOPEN\tfeature,tier-2\tfeat: Arrow-columnar REST/Salesforce → BigQuery via bucket-free Parquet load (DataFrame path)\n636\tOPEN\tfeature,tier-2\tfeat(core): vectorized Arrow-native transforms/quality/contract/masking (columnar governance)\n637\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-3\tfeat(serve-ui): three-tier button affordance (amber warn / red danger) for destructive actions\n638\tOPEN\tfeature,tier-2\tfeat(observability): protocol-agnostic upstream round-trip counter for every source/sink (roundtrips_total{op})\n639\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-1\tfix: lineage/catalog samplers disable the native fast path (5.4GB vs 150MB) — make samplers native/columnar-aware\n640\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2\tfix(catalog/lineage): query-based sources collapse to one dataset — dataset_uri() must include the object/table, not just the endpoint\n644\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tfeat(executor): cost-aware (LPT) dispatch order for matrix roots to cut makespan\n645\tCLOSED\tenhancement,tier-2\tfeat(serve-ui): per-matrix-row execution timing in the run detail + dashboards\n646\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-3\tfeat(serve-ui): Datasets/Lineage console UX — aligned table, filters, preview polish, lighter nodes\n647\tCLOSED\tenhancement,tier-2\tfeat: discovery-driven matrix fan-out — auto-enumerate source objects + fields (Salesforce first)\n648\tOPEN\tfeature,tier-2\tfeat: parameter-combination test suites for pipeline templates (faucet template test)\n649\tCLOSED\tfeature,tier-2\tfeat(rest/odata): PK-range partitioned extraction — within-object parallel chunk download\n651\tCLOSED\tenhancement,tier-1\tIntegration-test program: categorized end-to-end coverage of every shipped guarantee\n652\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2\tValue-path overwrite can persist a bookmark that outruns a failed commit_overwrite\n654\tOPEN\tbug,tier-1\tPrinciples audit: 4 silent-incorrectness paths (2 data-loss), a core retry-gate defect, and systemic config-strictness debt\n657\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2\tbug(sink-kafka): `headers_path` is parsed and extracted but never attached to the produced message\n658\tOPEN\tenhancement,tier-2\tenhancement(core/cli): carry a typed failure kind on `NodeReport` so topology runs get the same circuit-open cooldown as matrix runs\n662\tCLOSED\tbug,tier-2\tbug: SQL sources type a runtime query/connection failure as `FaucetError::Config`\n666\tOPEN\tbug,tier-2\tbug(serve): concurrent template_register on a SQLite history fails with `database is locked` (flakes a required CI check)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"82db8988-999b-4b63-9dbc-1b6339b53a57","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"