{"parentUuid":"ff29a385-1a3e-4855-9811-86acea2404b8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"23ad4779-0c1f-48fc-a10e-1c92c4154f79","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vu3LanyxFPcni2Ro8FExhs","type":"tool_result","content":"═══ #612/#614: is the load path actually used, and is it streaming?\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/config.rs:118:    /// Internal test hook: base URL for the media/resumable **upload** endpoint\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/config.rs:133:    pub resumable_chunk: Option<usize>,\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/config.rs:213:            resumable_chunk: None,\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/sink.rs:436:/// Upload one intermediate/final chunk to a resumable session and PUT its bytes.\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/sink.rs:437:/// Chunk size the streaming resumable upload flushes at (8 MiB, a multiple of\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/sink.rs:438:/// the 256 KiB alignment the resumable protocol requires for non-final chunks).\n--- load-job call sites in the write path\n187:fn build_load_job_json(\n194:    build_load_job_json_fmt(\n219:fn build_load_job_json_fmt(\n229:    build_load_job_json_full(\n243:fn build_load_job_json_full(\n558:    /// [`insert_overwrite_page`](Self::insert_overwrite_page).\n820:    async fn insert_overwrite_page(&self, records: &[Value]) -> Result<usize, FaucetError> {\n986:        let job_json = build_load_job_json(\n1116:        let job_json = build_load_job_json_full(\n1855:        // `begin_overwrite` + the deferred create in `insert_overwrite_page`.\n1857:            return self.insert_overwrite_page(records).await;\n1926:            self.insert_overwrite_page(records).await?;","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c85e62e0-db95-4431-81a6-cdfa215f47ea","timestamp":"2026-09-19T10:30:17.982Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"═══ #612/#614: is the load path actually used, and is it streaming?\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/config.rs:118:    /// Internal test hook: base URL for the media/resumable **upload** endpoint\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/config.rs:133:    pub resumable_chunk: Option<usize>,\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/config.rs:213:            resumable_chunk: None,\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/sink.rs:436:/// Upload one intermediate/final chunk to a resumable session and PUT its bytes.\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/sink.rs:437:/// Chunk size the streaming resumable upload flushes at (8 MiB, a multiple of\ncrates/sink/bigquery/src/sink.rs:438:/// the 256 KiB alignment the resumable protocol requires for non-final chunks).\n--- load-job call sites in the write path\n187:fn build_load_job_json(\n194:    build_load_job_json_fmt(\n219:fn build_load_job_json_fmt(\n229:    build_load_job_json_full(\n243:fn build_load_job_json_full(\n558:    /// [`insert_overwrite_page`](Self::insert_overwrite_page).\n820:    async fn insert_overwrite_page(&self, records: &[Value]) -> Result<usize, FaucetError> {\n986:        let job_json = build_load_job_json(\n1116:        let job_json = build_load_job_json_full(\n1855:        // `begin_overwrite` + the deferred create in `insert_overwrite_page`.\n1857:            return self.insert_overwrite_page(records).await;\n1926:            self.insert_overwrite_page(records).await?;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ff29a385-1a3e-4855-9811-86acea2404b8","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.267","gitBranch":"fix/inert-config-knobs","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
