{"parentUuid":"79d96ea1-7668-436a-ad98-3c4ac16586c5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfCefSziMbB5pGSzf9Fpr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UFkRQeQNJRbyXyxkMfhZZW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh auth switch --user PawanSikawat >/dev/null 2>&1\n\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh issue close 632 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --reason completed --comment \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nVerified against the code — implemented, closing.\n\n- `KeyCollision` enum in `crates/core/src/transform.rs` (`Error` | `Suffix`), carried on `RecordTransform::KeysCase { mode, on_collision }`.\n- **Default stays fail-loud**: `#[default] Error` fails the record naming the colliding key, so existing configs are unchanged.\n- `Suffix` appends `_2`, `_3`, … in original key order (first occurrence keeps the base name) — deterministic and order-stable, the `add_underscore_when_invalid` shape the issue asked for.\n- Wired through the CLI transform config (`cli/src/transforms.rs`: `on_collision` field → `KeysCase { on_collision }`), so it is reachable from YAML.\n- Tests: `keys_case_collision_errors_by_default`, `keys_case_collision_suffix_disambiguates`, `keys_case_collision_suffix_three_way`, `keys_case_collision_suffix_is_order_stable`.\n\nEvery acceptance criterion is met: unique + deterministic renaming, default unchanged, collision fixtures covered.\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1\n\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh issue close 637 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --reason completed --comment \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nVerified against the code — implemented, closing.\n\n`.btn-danger` and `.btn-warn` are defined in `cli/src/serve/ui/styles.css` (alongside `.btn-primary` / `.btn-ghost`) and applied exactly as the criteria specify:\n\n| Button | Class | View |\n|---|---|---|\n| `Purge older than N days` | `btn-warn` | `views/datasets.js` |\n| `Cancel` | `btn-warn` | `views/detail.js` |\n| `Discard` (DLQ) | `btn-warn` | `views/detail.js` |\n| `Deprecate` | `btn-warn` | `views/templates.js` |\n| `Delete` / `Delete now` / delete-all | `btn-danger` | `views/detail.js`, `views/datasets.js`, `views/templates.js` |\n\nNavigation and tabs are untouched (still `btn-ghost` / plain). Affordance only — no behaviour change.\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -1\necho \"closed 632, 637\"","description":"Close issues 632 and 637 with evidence"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1655,"cache_read_input_tokens":680957,"output_tokens":1980,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":936},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1655,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1980,"cache_read_input_tokens":680957,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1655},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01UFkRQeQNJRbyXyxkMfhZZW":{"command":"cd /Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh auth switch --user PawanSikawat >/dev/null 2>&1\n\n/opt/homebrew/bin/gh issue close 632 --repo faucet-hq/faucet-stream --reason completed --comment \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nVerified against the code — implemented, closing.\n\n- `KeyCollision` enum in `crates/core/src/transform.rs` (`Error` | `Suffix`), carried on `RecordTransform::KeysCase { mode, on_collision }`.\n- **Default stays fail-loud**: `#[default] Error` fails the record naming the colliding key, so existing configs are unchanged.\n- `Suffix` appends `_2`, `_3`, … in original key order (first occurrence keeps the base name) — deterministic and order-stable, the `add_underscore_