{"parentUuid":"baa4a0c3-fb21-4784-b0ee-fbd921460880","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"23ad4779-0c1f-48fc-a10e-1c92c4154f79","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013d3DKDkW8j4axM2M4vUtLe","type":"tool_result","content":"# CLI commands\n\nThe `faucet` binary exposes these commands. Pass `--log-level <level>` (or set\n`FAUCET_LOG`) to control logging.\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---------|--------------|\n| `faucet run [config]` | Run the pipeline(s) in a config file. |\n| `faucet validate [config]` | Parse, expand, and validate a config without running it. |\n| `faucet preview [config]` | Run only the source side and print records to stdout. |\n| `faucet schema <target>` | Print the JSON Schema for the whole config (`config`), a connector, a transform, or any block. |\n| `faucet list` | List every compiled-in source, sink, and transform with a one-line description. |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e84bca58-12c8-4278-a055-270a5bafab00","timestamp":"2026-09-19T11:46:14.478Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# CLI commands\n\nThe `faucet` binary exposes these commands. Pass `--log-level <level>` (or set\n`FAUCET_LOG`) to control logging.\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---------|--------------|\n| `faucet run [config]` | Run the pipeline(s) in a config file. |\n| `faucet validate [config]` | Parse, expand, and validate a config without running it. |\n| `faucet preview [config]` | Run only the source side and print records to stdout. |\n| `faucet schema <target>` | Print the JSON Schema for the whole config (`config`), a connector, a transform, or any block. |\n| `faucet list` | List every compiled-in source, sink, and transform with a one-line description. |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"baa4a0c3-fb21-4784-b0ee-fbd921460880","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/fauc